감차]</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br>2. 운행회수 : <font color=\"#ff0000\"><u>등·하교 각&nbsp;30</u></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #0000cd; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">회(15대 왕복)</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 운행 (증,감차&nbsp;될&nbsp;&nbsp;수 있음)<br>3. 운행노선 및 시간 : 첨부 자료 참조(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">추후 변경될 수 있음</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">)<br>4. 후원금 :&nbsp; 정액권 330,000<br>5. 후원금 납부기간 : 수시<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;*&nbsp;현재 성서고속도로다리밑 승차를 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">홈플러스와 구마고속도로 집입로 중간지점으로 이전(홈플러스에서 북쪽으로 약50미터지점)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;★ 통학버스 후원금</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #696969; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\"