E: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">405,600</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;6. 납부방법</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #696969; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #696969; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #696969; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. 납부금융기관 : 시중은행, 농협, 우체국<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나.&nbsp;납부방법 :&nbsp;인터넷지로,&nbsp;지로용지,&nbsp;가상계좌&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">입금시 필히 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학생의 학번 및 이름으로 입금&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;7. 교통카드 발급 안내<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">후원금을 입금한 영수증과 교통카드 보증금(10,000원)을 지참하여 학생회관</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1층 학사서비스센터에서 교통카드를 발급받아&nbsp;통학버스 이용.[</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">교통카드 보증금 10,000원은 버스를 이용후 (학기 말) 학사서비스센터에&nbsp;카드를 반납하면&nbsp;즉시&nbsp;환불 조치]</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #696969; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 다만,&nbsp;정기권 환불은&nbsp;월권금액으로 환불함.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;이용일수</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">*</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">월권금액=&gt;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 8.&nbsp;기타 문의사항은 054)478-7043-5</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 첨부자료 : 1. 통학버스 운행구간 및 시간표<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 후원금 납부요령<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 운행일수</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
